{"suttaId":"tha-ap496","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2602,2619],"vripara":"25"},"segments":{"tha-ap496:0.3":"Kiṃsukapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap496:1.1":"“Kiṃsukaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā, paggahetvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap496:1.3":"Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ saritvāna, ākāse abhipūjayiṃ.","tha-ap496:2.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap496:2.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap496:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap496:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap496:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap496:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap496:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap496:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kiṃsukapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap496:8.1":"Kiṃsukapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
